{"id":327,"name":"BNA","slug":"bna","synopsis":"In the 21st century, the existence of animal-humans came to light after being hidden in the darkness of history. Michiru lived life as a normal human, until one day she suddenly turns into a tanuki-human. She runs away and takes refuge in a special city area called \"Anima City\" that was set up 10 years ago for animal-humans to be able to live as themselves. There Michiru meets Shirou, a wolf-human who hates humans. Through Shirou, Michiru starts to learn about the worries, lifestyle, and joys of the animal-humans. As Michiru and Shirou try to learn why Michiru suddenly turned into an animal-human, they unexpectedly get wrapped up in a large incident.\n\n\n(Source: Anime News Network)\n\n\n*The TV broadcast ended on June 25, 2020.*","format":"TV","season":"SPRING","year":2020,"createdAt":"2021-03-27 00:43:33","updatedAt":"2021-03-28 00:38:55","resources":{"nodes":[{"site":"MAL","externalId":40060},{"site":"ANILIST","externalId":110354},{"site":"KITSU","externalId":42434},{"site":"ANIDB","externalId":14997},{"site":"ANN","externalId":22924},{"site":"ANIME_PLANET","externalId":13758},{"site":"OFFICIAL_SITE","externalId":null},{"site":"X","externalId":null},{"site":"NETFLIX","externalId":81220429}]},"images":{"nodes":[{"id":653,"facet":"LARGE_COVER","path":"anime/large-cover/X5zQUTGWYRtXZmkWy6WNz6NO9fWigm0Uy1D7NDXq.jpg"},{"id":654,"facet":"SMALL_COVER","path":"anime/small-cover/SWtO3ldjliFvtYjqjnUh1wO99hv5XuXnxUoxTI1X.avif"}]},"studios":{"nodes":[{"id":111,"name":"Trigger","slug":"trigger"}]},"series":{"nodes":[]},"animethemes":[{"id":9640,"slug":"OP1","type":"OP","sequence":null,"song":{"id":9641,"title":"Ready to","titleNative":null},"animethemeentries":[{"id":11327,"version":1,"episodes":"1-5","nsfw":false,"spoiler":false,"videos":{"nodes":[{"id":11523,"basename":"BrandNewAnimal-OP1.webm","filename":"BrandNewAnimal-OP1","link":"https://v.animethemes.moe/BrandNewAnimal-OP1.webm","mimetype":"video/webm","size":27548168,